.TH tkutimeentry n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutimeentry
.PP
Time entry with hour and minute spinboxes (optionally seconds). \fBgetTime\fR/ \fBsetTime\fR use \fBHH:MM\fR (or \fBHH:MM:SS\fR with \fB\-seconds\fR).
.SS API
.CS
set w [::tkutils::tkutimeentry::widget .t ?-time HH:MM? ?-increment min? \
        ?-seconds bool? ?-command cmd?]
::tkutils::tkutimeentry::getTime $w
::tkutils::tkutimeentry::setTime $w 09:30
.CE
.PP
\fB\-increment\fR is the minute step (default 5). \fB\-command\fR is called with the time string on change. \fBsetTime\fR rejects out\-of\-range/malformed input with \fB{TKUTILS TKTIMEENTRY TIME}\fR.
